1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,158
Buddyland: where everything is awesome, and the toughest question is what to play

2
00:00:04,158 --> 00:00:04,396
next.

3
00:00:04,616 --> 00:00:06,365
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,147
Buddyland has no special setup. Set up from the Setup card as normal.

5
00:00:11,967 --> 00:00:16,520
Its only special rule: the four spaces in the middle of the board with the joystick

6
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:19,647
icon are Arcade spaces. Several cards and Items use them.

7
00:00:19,867 --> 00:00:24,256
The Arcade Token, for example, is discarded in an Arcade space to trade three Time

8
00:00:24,256 --> 00:00:25,861
for the reward the card shows.

9
00:00:26,667 --> 00:00:31,030
The Birthday Girl gives four Time if you save her, but raises Bloodlust if she dies.

10
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:33,835
Buddy Up makes you save two or more Victims at a time.

11
00:00:34,055 --> 00:00:37,340
Sing-A-Long raises Horror every Upkeep until it reaches the red.

12
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:40,881
Nick the Janitor deals two damage to any Enemy whose space he enters.

13
00:00:41,101 --> 00:00:44,498
How'd They Sneak In? rolls three dice and adds a Victim for each:

14
00:00:44,498 --> 00:00:48,627
one or two the Jungle Gym, three or four the Dining Area, five or six the Party

15
00:00:48,627 --> 00:00:48,888
Room.

16
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:54,218
A few tips. The Items here are worth it: search the Dining Area, Prize Counter and

17
00:00:54,218 --> 00:00:54,713
Ball Pit.

18
00:00:54,933 --> 00:00:58,252
Exits are close together, so rescues are easier than usual.

19
00:00:58,252 --> 00:01:02,414
Use Arcade items in Arcade spaces, and lead Nick the Janitor into Buddies.

20
00:01:02,414 --> 00:01:02,976
Good luck.

